{"name": "Scared by Squares", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.poster.avif?t=1785368231\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.webm?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.mp4?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the entirety of Floor 1 with the free demo! Can you brave the unknown dangers of The Cube?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo will cover the entirety of Floor 1 and is available on standard (flatscreen) mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">==================================</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WARNING: Do not play if you\u2019re scared by squares.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scared by Squares is an exploration experience built entirely from cubes. Use your senses to navigate each room as you solve puzzles, survive platforming challenges, and hunt anomalies. What secrets will you uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game runs in both standard and VR modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.poster.avif?t=1785368231\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.webm?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.mp4?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been sent into The Cube, a digital prison made of perfect squares, to investigate reports of corrupted geometry. Your mission: locate and cleanse all anomalies and restore balance before they consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.poster.avif?t=1785368231\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.webm?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.mp4?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Test Your Skill</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between mind-bending puzzles, hidden traps, and cubic enemies lurking around each corner, every room you enter offers a new challenge. Harness all your will, focus, and courage to make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/8fff294f548c9046e8a763da201df956.poster.avif?t=1785368231\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/8fff294f548c9046e8a763da201df956.webm?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/8fff294f548c9046e8a763da201df956.mp4?t=1785368231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adapt &amp; Overcome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ongoing developments bring new challenges to your experience within The Cube. More floors and puzzles, new anomalies, and features such as multiplayer will be added as The Cube continues to expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">==================================</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Scared by Squares is an experiment in horror. Can you create fear without ghosts, zombies, creepy dolls, or the usual tropes? What if all you had was the least scary thing in the world: a simple cube? The result might surprise you.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/057100870b09df14b080c2e957554c4246556017/header.jpg?t=1785368231", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle", "Walking Simulator", "Exploration", "Mystery Dungeon", "Puzzle Platformer"], "developers": "Siege Industries", "publishers": "Siege Industries", "release_date": "Sep 24, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3719480", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/81MhGJo19pk", "first_seen": 1767999600.0, "review_rank": 1380}